    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\\m/ MetalVania Platformer \\m/</h2>Bad Pad is a old school platformer with metroidvania elements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Humorous story-line told in songs and animations, those buttons sure can sing!<br>    </li><li>Original guitar driven rock and metal soundtrack that will keep you pumped.<br>    </li><li>Over 12 hours of gameplay and 160 scenes to explore, metroidvania style.<br>    </li><li>Diverse gameplay with cart riding levels, submarine levels, spaceship levels and more.<br>    </li><li>10 epic boss levels.<br>    </li><li>In-game mini arcade games.<br>    </li><li>Cool pixel art graphics and a retro feel.<br>    </li><li>Tight controls and game mechanics + gamepad support.<br>    </li><li>Use of physics and changing gravity.<br>    </li><li>Environmental puzzles.<br>    </li><li>One item-based inventory system, hey a button doesn't have pockets, deal with it.<br>    </li><li>Three game difficulties to select from.<br>    </li><li>Lots of steam achievements.</li></ul><br>The wacky premise of Bad Pad is told in songs and is set around a gamepad's buttons who came to life, their endless battles, mind controlling machines and a little bit of time traveling.<br><br>Join Square in his adventures, survive Evil Pen's hellish castles, help save Hexa and Trapezoid and probably the rest of the world!<br><br>Give Bad Pad DEMO a try, it is always up-to-date and if you decide to buy to the full game you can continue playing with your saved progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/a711dcb09c964a6be499ccb5535a2422.avif?t=1745970981\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\\m/ MetalVania Platformer \\m/</h2>Bad Pad is a old school platformer with metroidvania elements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/6e49883d0eaa0b980e180e75813a1453.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/60ca329c4aeba4c3929aabe989ae54ce.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Humorous story-line told in songs and animations, those buttons sure can sing!<br>    </li><li>Original guitar driven rock and metal soundtrack that will keep you pumped.<br>    </li><li>Over 12 hours of gameplay and 160 scenes to explore, metroidvania style.<br>    </li><li>Diverse gameplay with cart riding levels, submarine levels, spaceship levels and more.<br>    </li><li>10 epic boss levels.<br>    </li><li>In-game mini arcade games.<br>    </li><li>Cool pixel art graphics and a retro feel.<br>    </li><li>Tight controls and game mechanics + gamepad support.<br>    </li><li>Use of physics and changing gravity.<br>    </li><li>Environmental puzzles.<br>    </li><li>One item-based inventory system, hey a button doesn't have pockets, deal with it.<br>    </li><li>Three game difficulties to select from.<br>    </li><li>Lots of steam achievements.</li></ul><br>The wacky premise of Bad Pad is told in songs and is set around a gamepad's buttons who came to life, their endless battles, mind controlling machines and a little bit of time traveling.<br><br>Join Square in his adventures, survive Evil Pen's hellish castles, help save Hexa and Trapezoid and probably the rest of the world!<br><br>Give Bad Pad DEMO a try, it is always up-to-date and if you decide to buy to the full game you can continue playing with your saved progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/ab7f06b31359f0dbb2ab4910eb912508.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.poster.avif?t=1745970981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.webm?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/e908507c67d50fac9e8d9975a5200f63.mp4?t=1745970981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517210/extras/a711dcb09c964a6be499ccb5535a2422.avif?t=1745970981\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Bad Pad is a metal pumped metroidvania platfomer about a gamepad's buttons who came to life. Oozing with original music and storytelling songs, all in the spirit of metal. Precision platforming, boss fighting, puzzle solving, mini games and more...",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Hebrew, Indonesian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cAn innovative adventure of an angered Square button unleashed from its controller\u2019s gamepad.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Indie Game Reviewer<br><br>\u201cComposed entirely in-house, there is a deliciously crunchy power metal score for each room that seamlessly transitions as you make your way through the game. Cutscenes are done as full musical numbers, giving the whole thing a Tenacious D feel.\u201d<br>Ready Up<br><br>\u201cMust Buy! We don't always have time to review everything, but we've personally played Bad Pad and think it's worth a buy. A great 2D platformer with an awesome soundtrack!\u201d<br>Steam Curators<br>",
